            "review_title": "Review at Đặc Sản Hoàng Tín",
            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nFresh and tasty!\nMar 2019 • Couples\nHonestly, there don't seem to be many good places in Da Nang. My wife and I here for the weekend found this place whilst looking for another eatery. We actually ate two nights in a row! Everything is fresh and the pork is very good. It's good value for what you get. I'd recommend it for sure. We will be back.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 11, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
