            "review_text": "bernie47801\nDenpasar, Indonesia1210 contributions\n0\nHurry on In\nMay 2018 • Couples\nWhat a great find this restaurant was. Clean and enticing from the street with signage showing some of their specialities. \n\nWe had the local noodle soup, which is big enough for two and our favourite fresh spring rolls. Both were delicious. \n\nFamilies and couples were there enjoying their meals. \n\nFresh food presented well. We will be back again very soon.\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2018",
