            "review_text": "Harry P\n1 contribution\n0\nNice local restaurant for pork wrap & roll\nApr 2018 • Friends\nVery reasonable rates. Traveler & tourist should try here when visiting Danang. This restaurant seems like famous to local people. Lots of locals eating here too it seems. Service was good. If you order the sliced pork rolled with ricepaper, be prepared for an enormous pile of greenery. I felt like a mountain goat, worth a try.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 18, 2018",
